{"id":"n62492-1-11","stage":1,"title":"가구 · 家具","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62492-1-11-1","ko":"집 정리는 다 끝났니?","zh":"家里整理完了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정리는","meaning":"整理，收拾，清理","explanation":"정리：整理，收拾，清理；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"정리","audio":"/audio/829a277fc72022a6ce35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75781","senseId":"1","lemma":"정리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝났니?","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完成；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"829a277fc72022a6","term":"정리","zh":"整理，收拾，清理","audio":"/audio/829a277fc72022a6ce35.mp3","entryId":"75781","definition":"将处于散乱状态的东西归整到一起或扔掉。","pronunciation":["정ː니"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"事情做完。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2526cd0adde7d778d875.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62492-1-11-2","ko":"아직 가구가 오지 않아 옷이나 책은 정리도 못 하고 있어.","zh":"家具还没送到，所以连衣服和书都还没来得及整理。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가구가","meaning":"家具","explanation":"가구：家具；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가구","audio":"/audio/7cd1a55d13c114f1190b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62492","senseId":"1","lemma":"가구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오지","meaning":"来，开来","explanation":"오다：来，开来；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"3","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않아","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷이나","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이나：连接可以选择的名词，表示“或、或者”。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책은","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정리도","meaning":"整理，收拾，清理","explanation":"정리：整理，收拾，清理；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"정리","audio":"/audio/829a277fc72022a6ce35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75781","senseId":"1","lemma":"정리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하고","meaning":"做、进行（정리를 하다：整理）","explanation":"하다：做、进行（정리를 하다：整理）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"7cd1a55d13c114f1","term":"가구","zh":"家具","audio":"/audio/7cd1a55d13c114f1190b.mp3","entryId":"62492","definition":"家庭用的工具，如床、衣柜、餐桌等。","pronunciation":["가구"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，开来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"交通工具朝着某个基准的地方运行。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"829a277fc72022a6","term":"정리","zh":"整理，收拾，清理","audio":"/audio/829a277fc72022a6ce35.mp3","entryId":"75781","definition":"将处于散乱状态的东西归整到一起或扔掉。","pronunciation":["정ː니"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做、进行（정리를 하다：整理）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做、进行（정리를 하다：整理）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a8e96f58830b5f2f91c5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.872,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62492","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":56,"sequenceScore":2.4696,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["家具还没送到，所以连衣服和书都还没来得及整理。","您哪里不舒服？","家里整理完了吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["家具还没送到，所以连衣服和书都还没来得及整理。","家里整理完了吗？","您哪里不舒服？"],"answer":0}]}
